<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B Difficulty Map Construction and Calibration ‣ Spatial CAPTCHA: Generatively Benchmarking Spatial Reasoning for Human-Machine Differentiation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span>Binning strategies and priors</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
