<td id="A3.T4.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">Spatial perception and reference system</td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
